<!--
  HAND-COMMITTED. ubrn won't regenerate this.

  `android/build.gradle` (which ubrn DOES generate) points
  `manifest.srcFile` at this file for AGP 8+, where the `package` attribute in
  a library manifest is an error rather than a deprecation. ubrn only renders
  `AndroidManifest.xml`, so without this file committed the Gradle project
  fails to configure on a fresh checkout. It is also listed in
  `ubrn.config.yaml`'s `noOverwrite` so a future ubrn that starts rendering it
  cannot replace this one.

  ZERO PERMISSIONS, deliberately, and asserted by security invariant 29.
  Everything this package touches is reached through the Storage Access
  Framework with a user-granted document URI: `ACTION_OPEN_DOCUMENT` needs no
  permission, and asking for one would both widen the app's declared surface
  and change the Play Data Safety answers.
-->
